# AUTHORED-BY Codex GPT-6.1-Sol
# PM ContactDoc uses #it, direct mailto/tel/url; ORG also occurs on imported PM data.
@prefix vcard: <http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#> .
<#it> a vcard:Individual; vcard:fn "Pat Morgan";
  vcard:hasEmail <mailto:pat@example.org>, <mailto:work@example.org>;
  vcard:hasTelephone <tel:+44123>, <tel:+44567>;
  vcard:url <https://pat.example/profile#me>;
  vcard:organization-name "PM Inc"; vcard:note "Original note" .
